plugin-qualify (0.21.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * ci: the container jobs mark the checkout safe, so git reads it
  * packaging: the store floor is plugin-db-qualification 2026112401
  * packaging: 0.21.1 declares the -contract package 0.21.0 stopped building
  * release: plugin-qualify 0.21.1 (the v0.21.0 release fixed forward)
  * ci, publish: the suite runs in a fedora:45 container with the channel,
    where plugin-hostd 0.21 is served
  * test-setup: the tests' contract directory is the installed one, whole,
    with the named overlays
  * store: the spawned commands get the installed contract directory unless
    one is named
  * plugin-qualify-sync: import QualificationStore, which the stored-plugin
    count constructs
  * release: a rerun keeps the tarball already attached with the same bytes
  * release: the Fedora install check names omx-clap-libs as the owner of the
    hosting codes
  * packaging: every shipped script is executable, so lintian passes the DEB

